{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to share my pre-use inspection findings. During my inspection of the solvent-recovery skid, I found that the transfer pump seal must be replaced and pressure-tested before the skid can be operated. The replacement takes exactly 3 hours, and the seal kit is already in the maintenance storeroom. I recorded this finding on a paper inspection sheet, but it has not yet been entered into the electronic work-order system. So from a maintenance standpoint, the skid is not currently ready for operation — we need to complete this seal replacement and pressure test first."}
```

